 muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334430/extras/b58edf9061857ac8f21507e15ddecd74.poster.avif?t=1748954087\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334430/extras/b58edf9061857ac8f21507e15ddecd74.webm?t=1748954087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334430/extras/cc1a88c0842f3c3ce37a3625648e39f2.avif?t=1748954087\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fool's Apprentice returns to The Planar Danse once again, the connected universe of Apollyon, Skulltide, and Spirit's Almanac, the previous games and novel set within the same world. It is endlessly replayable, but all unlocks can be unlocked in ~8 hours of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the future of magic, today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334430/extras/c6d46ea34c104f297434b8a0e792b6e5.avif?t=1748954087\" data-has-big width=800 height=413 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A wizard academy management sim where you\u2014an obviously benevolent professor\u2014must manage &amp; cast spells on your many apprentices so that they might study the right spells\u2026 and perhaps even survive the researching process. Some may die, but oh well, can\u2019t save them all!",
